Accordingly, it is directed that applicant Mahendra shall be released on bail in relation to Crime No.593 of 2023 registered at Police Station Chachoda District Guna (M.P.) for offence punishable under Sections 302, 201 and added Section 376 (D) of IPC, upon furnishing a personal bond in the sum of Rs.1,00,000/- (Rupees One Lakh Only) with one solvent surety of the same amount to the satisfaction of the Trial Court, for compliance with the following conditions,: (For convenience of understanding by accused and surety, the conditions of bail are also reproduced in Hindi as under):-
